      "subject": "Eliyahu sɛbɛn",
      "rationale": "Waati-jatebaliya gɛlɛya: sɛbɛnniw bɛ fɔ ko Eliyahu tun bɔra Yehoram ka ɲɛnamaya tɔgɔda (2K 2) — sɛbɛn in nana waati jumɛn? Fɔliw: sɛbɛn in tun sɛbɛnna kafa; walima a nana kɔfɛ u ye a wele 'nabi' k'a tɔgɔ mara."
