  "translation": "Sɛbɛn dɔ nana a ye Eliyahu (Iliya), nabi in fɛ, a ko: ko cogo nin Yawe, Dawid (Dawuda) i fa Elohim, fɔra: sabu i ma taa i fa Yehoshafat siraw la, ani i ma taa Asa, Yehuda masakɛ, siraw la.",
